# .secretignore — allowlist for scripts/scan-secrets.sh
# Created: 2026-04-19 (3-Brain Pipeline v3 Patch 1)
# Hardened: 2026-04-20 — dropped rotated-secret literal allowlists. The scanner
# no longer stores historical credential values as literal regex (per Codex review);
# generic character-class patterns catch them automatically.
#
# FORMAT (one entry per line):
#   # comment                                          — ignored
#   docs/path/file.md                                  — allowlist ALL secrets in file (dangerous)
#   docs/path/file.md::pattern-name                    — allowlist ONE pattern in ONE file (safe)
#   @pattern-name                                      — allowlist pattern globally (very dangerous)
#
# Pattern names (from scan-secrets.sh):
#   anthropic-api-key, openai-project-key, openai-standard-key,
#   google-api-key, slack-bot-token, github-pat, github-fg-pat,
#   aws-access-key, postgres-url, mongodb-url, mysql-url,
#   jwt-token, rotated-password-shape, pem-private-key, ssh-private-key

# ============================================
# Incident documentation — real historical leak references
# Credentials are DEAD (rotated 2026-04-19). These docs intentionally reference
# the leaked fingerprints as part of the incident record, and the values match the
# generic google-api-key / postgres-url patterns. Allowlist scoped to these files.
# ============================================
docs/ai-workflow/AI-HANDOFF/SECURITY-REMEDIATION-2026-04-19.md::google-api-key
docs/ai-workflow/AI-HANDOFF/SECURITY-REMEDIATION-2026-04-19.md::postgres-url
docs/ai-workflow/AI-HANDOFF/3-BRAIN-PIPELINE-PLAN-v2-2026-04-19.md::google-api-key
docs/ai-workflow/AI-HANDOFF/3-BRAIN-PIPELINE-PLAN-v3-FINAL-2026-04-19.md::google-api-key
docs/ai-workflow/AI-HANDOFF/3-BRAIN-PIPELINE-CODEX-REVIEW-BRIEFING-2026-04-19.md::google-api-key
docs/ai-workflow/AI-HANDOFF/3-BRAIN-PIPELINE-V3-PATCHES-2026-04-19.md::google-api-key
docs/ai-workflow/AI-HANDOFF/3-BRAIN-PIPELINE-V3-PATCHES-2026-04-19.md::postgres-url
docs/ai-workflow/AI-HANDOFF/OPUS-CODEX-DEBATE-3-BRAIN-PIPELINE-V3-2026-04-19.md::google-api-key
docs/ai-workflow/AI-HANDOFF/OPUS-CODEX-DEBATE-3-BRAIN-PIPELINE-V3-2026-04-19.md::postgres-url

